=product @PRODUCER@ @BASE@ VTREE @PCSIVERSION@ full
1 'PRODUCER
=prompt @PRODUCER@
1 'PRODUCT
=prompt VTREE @VERSION@ for OpenVMS (vms-vtree): a full-screen file manager in DEC style, early test
1 'NOTICE
=prompt VTREE is distributed under the MIT licence. This is an early test release.
1 RELEASE_NOTES
=prompt Documentation is in [VTREE]README.VMS under the installation directory.
1 POST_INSTALL
=prompt Post-installation tasks for VTREE (vms-vtree)
    At boot, add to SYS$MANAGER:SYSTARTUP_VMS.COM:
    $ @SYS$STARTUP:VTREE$STARTUP.COM
    For users, in SYS$MANAGER:SYLOGIN.COM or their LOGIN.COM:
    $ @VTREE$ROOT:[000000]VTREE$SETUP.COM

PRODUCT REMOVE VTREE deassigns VTREE$ROOT and VTREE. Operation logs
(SYS$LOGIN:VTREE.LOG) are users' own files and are kept.
